abstract: >-
  Draft is a parametric generation tool for design and controller exploration
  using medium-fidelity robot models, without CAD. A generalized engine compiles
  any parametric robot tree into a simulation-ready MJCF model. The free
  parameters of a design are grounded in trends fitted to a survey of 114
  actuators and 49 published robot descriptions, validated end to end by
  rebuilding four off-the-shelf platforms to 1.10x geometric mean fold error in
  total mass.
keywords:
  - robotics
  - robot design
  - co-design
  - MuJoCo
  - MJCF
  - actuator scaling
  - legged robots
